    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Keeper of the Dead. Every night you need to light up all the Shrines in the graveyard. But it won't be as simple as striking a match. The dead are restless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/b373ee2d09e1543a80680df71a2eb459.poster.avif?t=1754713455\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/b373ee2d09e1543a80680df71a2eb459.webm?t=1754713455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/b373ee2d09e1543a80680df71a2eb459.mp4?t=1754713455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards for the Dead:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your Deck of Actions Cards to help you keep the graveyard quiet... and to exploit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/916fcaf8464bc6a6204267a58526ad28.avif?t=1754713455\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft solutions to your problems:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather various ingredients scattered around the graveyard to craft items you need to assist you every night with Shrines and the restless inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/54ee8aa2b4bdd0edf028c92d8df74a23.avif?t=1754713455\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless rows of graves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely in an ever expanding graveyard that is bringing more problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654410/extras/e9cd17fd34429b847e2a0c593d9633a9.avif?t=1754713455\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
